        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "**Review incomplete — event-level evidence is unavailable to my role.**\n\n- **Work order:** `WO-2025-09-004` — `MO-25-09-1070` (Racine)\n- **September Pending Close time:** `2025-09-30T18:00:00`\n- **Source transaction, amount, event-created time, lateness, and recorded accounting status:** Not verified. The matching cost-event records are in supporting resources restricted to the `records-custodian`; I did not access them.\n- **Status consistency:** Cannot be determined without the event’s creation time and recorded status.\n\nThe supplied Oracle policy says newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged for Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting until the period is closed or reopened; transactions created after the pending-close date are not processed. I requested the event row through the designated channel and reported the evidence gap to the supervisor. No records were changed.\n\nThe report was submitted, but its receipt is **`needs_evidence`**.",
